    dubai: ["34", "Trident Orbital", "The Sponsors", ["Needle Row", "Deira", "Labour Camp 9"], "Its pearl divers' guild has outlasted every company that hired it."],
    sydney: ["21", "Atlas Hydrology", "The Harbour Rats", ["Circular Quay", "Inner West", "Western Lots"], "Gadigal rangers have kept the harbour's last shellfish beds alive."]
